OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud will
OL,6,Fthicken from the northwest this
OL,7,Fevening, heralding a rather wet night
OL,8,Fto come with some heavy bursts of rain
OL,9,Fdeveloping at times. The rain
OL,10,Fgradually clearing to the south by
OL,11,Fmorning. Staying quite warm and humid
OL,12,Ftoo.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FThe overnight rain will clear
OL,15,Faway to the south on Friday morning,
OL,16,Fleaving a generally dry and bright
OL,17,Fday. Feeling fresher, but still
OL,18,Fpleasantly warm in the sunshine.
OL,19,FBreezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
